{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VBis1nU8RNe5ch9ARR7xuU","type":"tool_result","content":"316:const HOOKS = { input: [], step: [], enter: [], draw: [], rot: null, frame: null, pose: null, pause: null }, FADES = {};\n2219:      this._tg = this._vG; for (const f of HOOKS.draw) f(game, this, this._vG); for (const f of this._overlays) f(this._vG); this._tg = null;\n2232:      for (const f of HOOKS.draw) f(game, this, g);\n3303:HOOKS.step.push((g, dt) => {\n3510:HOOKS.step.push((g, dt) => {\n3515:HOOKS.draw.push((g, r, ctx) => { const w = g.weather, S = g._wx; if (w && w.kind && S && WEATHER[w.kind]) _wxDraw(g, r, ctx, S, w, WEATHER[w.kind]); });\n3587:HOOKS.input.push(g => { for (const I of g._players || [g.input]) {   // (each player's own history: game.players)\n3753:HOOKS.input.push((game, dt) => {\n502:- `game.start(hooks)`: Start the loop. Either one scene: game.start({ update(dt), draw(r) }) or several: game.start({ scenes: { title: {...}, play: {...} }, scene: 'title' }) A scene is { enter(data), exit(), update(dt), draw(r), back(), pausable, view, views, input, res, expand, touch, camera } (all optional). start() with nothing resumes a stopped loop. A headless game, or one made with loop: false, runs only by advance().\n703:- `E.MOVES: slash, backslash, overhead, rising, thrust, spin, plunge, twohand, jab, cross, hook, uppercut, haymaker, elbow, ... (24)`: a library of named attacks with timing and body motion (anticipation, lunge, step, twist, hop). new E.Attack('overhead'), new E.Attack('thrust', { reach: 10 }), new E.Combo(['jab', 'cross', 'hook', 'uppercut']) rig.update(dt, { ..., attack: E.move('roundhouse', .5) }) // any move at any moment, for previews and cutscenes The same move works on every build and in every view: heights are relative to the shoulders (rel: true), reaches scale with arm length, and horizontal swings turn into screen-plane swings in side views. A move's spec fields:\n884:- `hero.swingFrom(x, z, len)` †: hang from a point (a grapple's hook, a whip's ring): a pendulum from (x, z) to its hands, len long (the distance now by default); left and right pump it, jump lets go with its speed (release() does too)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17","uuid":"73d00e9c-0929-4578-8c76-5c4fb26212ac","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:04:27.089Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"316:const HOOKS = { input: [], step: [], enter: [], draw: [], rot: null, frame: null, pose: null, pause: null }, FADES = {};\n2219:      this._tg = this._vG; for (const f of HOOKS.draw) f(game, this, this._vG); for (const f of this._overlays) f(this._vG); this._tg = null;\n2232:      for (const f of HOOKS.draw) f(game, this, g);\n3303:HOOKS.step.push((g, dt) => {\n3510:HOOKS.step.push((g, dt) => {\n3515:HOOKS.draw.push((g, r, ctx) => { const w = g.weather, S = g._wx; if (w && w.kind && S && WEATHER[w.kind]) _wxDraw(g, r, ctx, S, w, WEATHER[w.kind]); });\n3587:HOOKS.input.push(g => { for (const I of g._players || [g.input]) {   // (each player's own history: game.players)\n3753:HOOKS.input.push((game, dt) => {\n502:- `game.start(hooks)`: Start the loop. Either one scene: game.start({ update(dt), draw(r) }) or several: game.start({ scenes: { title: {...}, play: {...} }, scene: 'title' }) A scene is { enter(data), exit(), update(dt), draw(r), back(), pausable, view, views, input, res, expand, touch, camera } (all optional). start() with nothing resumes a stopped loop. A headless game, or one made with loop: false, runs only by advance().\n703:- `E.MOVES: slash, backslash, overhead, rising, thrust, spin, plunge, twohand, jab, cross, hook, uppercut, haymaker, elbow, ... (24)`: a library of named attacks with timing and body motion (anticipation, lunge, step, twist, hop). new E.Attack('overhead'), new E.Attack('thrust', { reach: 10 }), new E.Combo(['jab', 'cross', 'hook', 'uppercut']) rig.update(dt, { ..., attack: E.move('roundhouse', .5) }) // any move at any moment, for previews and cutscenes The same move works on every build and in every view: heights are relative to the shoulders (rel: true), reaches scale with arm length, and horizontal swings turn into screen-plane swings in side views. A move's spec fields:\n884:- `hero.swingFrom(x, z, len)` †: hang from a point (a grapple's hook, a whip's ring): a pendulum from (x, z) to its hands, len long (the distance now by default); left and right pump it, jump lets go with its speed (release() does too)","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VBis1nU8RNe5ch9ARR7xuU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
