{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018nNHbbsEJagJzfbZqWtcsY","type":"tool_result","content":"1786\t### 15.5 Engine patches (each marked in the source and listed in `engine/PATCHES.md`; they feed the Engine Feedback)\n1787\t\n1788\t| # | Patch | Why |\n1789\t|---|---|---|\n1790\t| P1 | `E.HOOKS = HOOKS;` just after `HOOKS` is declared | The game must switch every player's input preset each step, before the Shell reads navigation: arrows aim in play and navigate in menus. |\n1791\t| P2 | The standard `glyphs` setting defaults to `'playstation'`, offers PlayStation or Xbox, and its `apply` sets `glyphs` on every `game.players` input | TASK.md wants PlayStation glyphs by default with an Xbox option. The stock default is `'auto'`, and only P1 is updated. |\n1792\t| P3 | `E.Arcade.enter(score, mode, done, input)` reads the given input (default `game.input`); `continue()` takes a press from any `game.players` input | In co-op each player enters their own initials, and anyone may continue. |\n1793\t| P4 | `get bus() { this._init(); return this._sfxBus; }` on the audio object | Babble voices must pass through the effects bus to obey volume and mute. |\n1794\t\n1795\t**§15.6** is the same list, under the name §1 and §4 point to. Patch only what the game can't do itself: CSS\n1796\toverrides and our own UI need no patch. Any further patch found necessary while building is added to this list with its\n1797\treason.\n1798\t\n1799\t### 15.7 Coding rules"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17","uuid":"80ec75df-a2f8-45f2-899b-a80418e73719","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:44:00.341Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/work/PLAN.md","content":"### 15.5 Engine patches (each marked in the source and listed in `engine/PATCHES.md`; they feed the Engine Feedback)\n\n| # | Patch | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| P1 | `E.HOOKS = HOOKS;` just after `HOOKS` is declared | The game must switch every player's input preset each step, before the Shell reads navigation: arrows aim in play and navigate in menus. |\n| P2 | The standard `glyphs` setting defaults to `'playstation'`, offers PlayStation or Xbox, and its `apply` sets `glyphs` on every `game.players` input | TASK.md wants PlayStation glyphs by default with an Xbox option. The stock default is `'auto'`, and only P1 is updated. |\n| P3 | `E.Arcade.enter(score, mode, done, input)` reads the given input (default `game.input`); `continue()` takes a press from any `game.players` input | In co-op each player enters their own initials, and anyone may continue. |\n| P4 | `get bus() { this._init(); return this._sfxBus; }` on the audio object | Babble voices must pass through the effects bus to obey volume and mute. |\n\n**§15.6** is the same list, under the name §1 and §4 point to. Patch only what the game can't do itself: CSS\noverrides and our own UI need no patch. Any further patch found necessary while building is added to this list with its\nreason.\n\n### 15.7 Coding rules","numLines":14,"startLine":1786,"totalLines":1996}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018nNHbbsEJagJzfbZqWtcsY","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh3KGdLKXLkUhZUXVz7t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U22w8KWXC4i2oF6gjt2Hfu","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/work/PLAN.md","old_string":"**§15.6** is the same list, under the name §1 and §4 point to. Patch only what the game can't do itself: CSS\noverrides and our own UI need no patch. Any further patch found necessary while building is added to this list with its\nreason.\n\n### 15.7 Coding rules","new_string":"Patch only what the game can't do itself: CSS overrides and our own UI need no patch. If the build needs another patch,\nadd it to this table with its reason.\n\n### 15.6 Coding rules"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":831,"cache_read_input_tokens":472191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":831},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c819b0f-1b18-471b-b765-9dcf56869a17","uuid":"017301fb-b87a-4b82-9be1-4b13c0c8d209","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:44:03.692Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh3KGNCY2JosEXEAkyYx","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01U22w8KWXC4i2oF6gjt2Hfu":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174807__x5c5240/work/PLAN.md","old_string":"**§15.6** is the same list, under the name §1 and §4 point to. Patch only what the game can't do itself: CSS\noverrides and our own UI need no patch. Any further patch found necessary while building is added to this list with its\nreason.\n\n### 15.7 Coding rules","new_string":"Patch only what the game can't do itself: CSS overrides and our ow